# E2E specs

- Import `test` and `expect` from `src/fixtures/test.fixture.ts`.
- Use page objects from fixtures. Do not declare locators in specs.
- Keep flow and expectations in the spec; keep selectors in the page class.
- Generated sandbox accounts: create them only via `registerAndOnboard()` (it writes `testdata/generated/registrations.json`). After mutating that account, call `recordAccountUpdate()`. Never log the same registration twice from the spec.

```typescript
// BAD
test('login', async ({ page }) => {
  await page.locator('#email').fill('user@test.com');
});

// GOOD
test('logs in a brand user', async ({ loginPage }) => {
  await loginPage.open();
  await loginPage.login(brandEmail, brandPassword);
  await loginPage.expectLoggedIn();
});
```
